  "problemStatement": {
    "formal": "\\sum_{k=0}^{n-1} e^{ik\\theta} = \\frac{e^{in\\theta}-1}{e^{i\\theta}-1}\n\\quad(e^{i\\theta}\\neq 1),\n\\qquad\n\\sum_{k=0}^{n-1}\\cos(k\\theta) = \\tfrac12 + \\frac{\\sin\\!\\big((n-\\tfrac12)\\theta\\big)}{2\\sin(\\theta/2)}.",
